# =================================
# Backup files
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
*.save
*~

# Temporary files
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp
*.temp
.#*

# Archive files (usually not needed in repo)
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z

